id: way-of-the-warrior
name: Way of the Warrior
order: 1
optionOf: quick-to-master
optionEffect: 3
description: >
  When you use the Signature Technique Maneuver, you may reduce your Life Points by up to 10(bT) to gain a free Ki Wager on this Attacking Maneuver equal to the reduction.
text: >
  Way of the Warrior [Triggered]: When you use the Signature Technique Maneuver, you may reduce your Life Points by up to 10(bT) to gain a free Ki Wager on this Attacking Maneuver equal to the reduction.

---

# Asked as a Signature Technique is declared, every time: the Life Points given up, up to 10(bT) and what is left - as
# much on its Ki Wager, outside its price (use-maneuver.mjs askTechniqueDeclaration).
[passive]
allow signature.lifeWager;
